- log₂ n
- n
- n log₂ n
- n²
- 2ⁿ
hint: A constant never grows, however big it is.
hint: For big n: log n < n < n log n < n².
right: 1 < log n < n < n log n < n² < 2ⁿ. When simplifying, keep the term that comes last in this order.
wrong: A constant (1,000) never grows. Then log n, n, n log n, n², and 2ⁿ, which overtakes them all.

